      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2723269207,
          "type": null,
          "body": "There are still quite a few FT_UINT fields in this dissector that are added with ENC_NA encoding (so BIG_ENDIAN).  We'd prefer to be explicit wherever possible - below are the warnings still shown in the pipeline (towards bottom of Clang and Code Checks) of this MR.  Do you know which (if any) parts of this dissector should be LITTLE_ENDIAN?\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ieee80211.c:21818 proto_tree_add_item_ret_uint called for FT_UINT16 field \"hf_ieee80211_vs_sgdsn_heading\"  - with bad encoding - \"ENC_NA\" - {'ENC_BIG_ENDIAN', 'ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN', 'ENC_HOST_ENDIAN'} allowed\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ieee80211.c:21790 proto_tree_add_item_ret_int called for FT_INT32 field \"hf_ieee80211_vs_sgdsn_gpscoord\"  - with bad encoding - \"ENC_NA\" - {'ENC_BIG_ENDIAN', 'ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN', 'ENC_HOST_ENDIAN'} allowed\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ieee80211.c:21800 proto_tree_add_item_ret_int called for FT_INT16 field \"hf_ieee80211_vs_sgdsn_altitude\"  - with bad encoding - \"ENC_NA\" - {'ENC_BIG_ENDIAN', 'ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN', 'ENC_HOST_ENDIAN'} allowed\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ieee80211.c:38811 proto_tree_add_bitmask called for FT_UINT16 field \"hf_ieee80211_he_trigger_ranging_common_info_2\"  - with bad encoding - \"ENC_NA\" - {'ENC_BIG_ENDIAN', 'ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN', 'ENC_HOST_ENDIAN'} allowed\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ieee80211.c:38862 proto_tree_add_bitmask_with_flags called for FT_UINT40 field \"hf_ieee80211_tack_next_twt_info\"  - with bad encoding - \"ENC_NA\" - {'ENC_BIG_ENDIAN', 'ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN', 'ENC_HOST_ENDIAN'} allowed\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ieee80211.c:10464 proto_tree_add_item called for FT_UINT16 field \"hf_ieee80211_ff_anqp_nw_auth_type_ts_msec\"  - with bad encoding - \"ENC_NA\" - {'ENC_BIG_ENDIAN', 'ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN', 'ENC_HOST_ENDIAN'} allowed\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ieee80211.c:12547 proto_tree_add_item called for FT_UINT32 field \"hf_ieee80211_ff_tod\"  - with bad encodin