        {
          "id": 2723414061,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I can definitely update the test in the script to accept ENC_NA if the length in the call is only 1 byte (even though the field is defined as 8 bytes, and used that way within a bitmask set).  I may not have time today though.\n\nThere are still some cases where 2-byte fields are being added with ENC_NA, e.g., hf_ieee80211_tag_sta_beam_track at line 36627.",
